// 楓谷幫手在 Cloudflare（v1.33）。網頁是 out/ 的靜態檔（npm run build:cf 產生），API 跟道具圖轉發在 cf/worker.ts。
// 正式機：maplehelper（APP_ENV=production）；測試機：--env dev → maplehelper-dev（APP_ENV=preview，練功測速／野王的資料跟正式機分開）。
// 秘密（不進版控）：DATABASE_URL、SPEED_SALT 用 `wrangler secret put <名稱> [--env dev]` 設。
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "maplehelper",
  "main": "cf/worker.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  // nodejs_compat：node:crypto 跟 process.env（vars、secrets 會自動放進 process.env）
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat"],
  "assets": {
    "directory": "out",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page",
    "run_worker_first": ["/api/*", "/assets/items/*"]
  },
  "services": [{ "binding": "ITEMS", "service": "maplehelper-items" }],
  "vars": { "APP_ENV": "production" },
  // 贊助付款端點防灌（v2.25，cf/worker.ts donateBlocked）：同位址一分鐘 5 次；period 只能 10 或 60
  "ratelimits": [{ "name": "DONATE_LIMITER", "namespace_id": "2501", "simple": { "limit": 5, "period": 60 } }],
  "observability": { "enabled": true },
  "env": {
    "dev": {
      "name": "maplehelper-dev",
      "assets": {
        "directory": "out",
        "binding": "ASSETS",
        "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
        "not_found_handling": "404-page",
        "run_worker_first": ["/api/*", "/assets/items/*"]
      },
      "services": [{ "binding": "ITEMS", "service": "maplehelper-items-dev" }],
      "vars": { "APP_ENV": "preview" },
      "ratelimits": [{ "name": "DONATE_LIMITER", "namespace_id": "2502", "simple": { "limit": 5, "period": 60 } }]
    }
  }
}
